  questDescription: My cat Mittens is a lousy hunter. Her claws are like butter knives,
    I want them razor sharp! She should also be quite a bit quicker, and, well, a
    little luck never hurts when chasing mice.
  requirements:
  - type: 3
    tier: 3
  - type: 2
    tier: 2
  - type: 5
    tier: 0
  successText: Mittens caught three mice before breakfast. Purrfect!
  partialText: She caught one mouse. A small one. Fine.
  failureText: She shredded the sofa and then fell off it. Out!
